Orbit Remote is a personal native remote desktop project.

The native streaming client derives from Moonlight Qt at
https://github.com/moonlight-stream/moonlight-qt
revision a57e947d7185fd01384f6973df4df59ae2968d01.
Moonlight Qt and Orbit client modifications are licensed under GPL-3.0.
The upstream LICENSE and copyright notices remain in vendor/moonlight.
Orbit client modifications are available in client/ and scripts/apply-client.py.

Sunshine is a separately installed GPL-3.0 streaming host from
https://github.com/LizardByte/Sunshine. Its license remains in the downloaded
runtime. Orbit does not claim authorship of either upstream engine.

The Orbit Windows host companion and project build scripts are also GPL-3.0.
